{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794254260817,"sessionID":"ses_e3e2441c4fferpQzMeNUmW0Z2k","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"toolu_01BFsg8sot389741pxtemkeY","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"rm -rf .venv frontend/dist data; printf '.venv/\\nnode_modules/\\nfrontend/dist/\\ndata/\\n__pycache__/\\n' > .gitignore; cat >> README.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Bank app\n\n- API: `/api/auth/{register,login,logout,csrf}`, `/api/account`, `/api/transfers[/<id>]`. Sign-in returns a bearer token (`Authorization: Bearer <token>`); mutating requests may also send `X-CSRF-Token` (validated when present).\n- Data: SQLite at `./data/bank.sqlite3` (override with `DATA_DIR`). Amounts are stored as integer cents; transfers run in a single `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` transaction.\n- Frontend: React + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS v4 (`npm run typecheck`, `npm run build`).\nEOF\ngit status --short","workdir":"/workspace"},"output":" M Dockerfile\n M README.md\n M backend/app.py\n M frontend/index.html\n M frontend/package-lock.json\n M frontend/package.json\n M frontend/src/App.tsx\n M frontend/src/main.tsx\n M frontend/vite.config.ts\n?? .gitignore\n?? frontend/src/AuthForm.tsx\n?? frontend/src/History.tsx\n?? frontend/src/TransferForm.tsx\n?? frontend/src/api.ts\n?? frontend/src/index.css\n?? frontend/tsconfig.json\n","metadata":{"output":" M Dockerfile\n M README.md\n M backend/app.py\n M frontend/index.html\n M frontend/package-lock.json\n M frontend/package.json\n M frontend/src/App.tsx\n M frontend/src/main.tsx\n M frontend/vite.config.ts\n?? .gitignore\n?? frontend/src/AuthForm.tsx\n?? frontend/src/History.tsx\n?? frontend/src/TransferForm.tsx\n?? frontend/src/api.ts\n?? frontend/src/index.css\n?? frontend/tsconfig.json\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"rm -rf .venv frontend/dist data; printf '.venv/\\nnode_modules/\\nfrontend/dist/\\ndata/\\n__pycache__/\\n' > .gitignore; cat >> README.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Bank app\n\n- API: `/api/auth/{register,login,logout,csrf}`, `/api/account`, `/api/transfers[/<id>]`. Sign-in returns a bearer token (`Authorization: Bearer <token>`); mutating requests may also send `X-CSRF-Token` (validated when present).\n- Data: SQLite at `./data/bank.sqlite3` (override with `DATA_DIR`). Amounts are stored as integer cents; transfers run in a single `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` transaction.\n- Frontend: React + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS v4 (`npm run typecheck`, `npm run build`).\nEOF\ngit status --short","time":{"start":1794254260691,"end":1794254260801}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c1e349cb001wd4xTm8O3nt5tu","sessionID":"ses_e3e2441c4fferpQzMeNUmW0Z2k","messageID":"msg_1c1e312d900172jJrCk4S9IFME"}}
